STEP 1 -- IS THE PLANCK-FLOOR COUPLING A DERIVED NUMBER OR AN EXTRAPOLATION?
==============================================================================
  at M_Z:   1/alpha_2 = 29.585   1/alpha_Y = 98.366   sum = 127.951  (= 1/alpha(M_Z))
  ln(M_Pl/M_Z) = 39.436
  at M_Pl:  1/alpha_2 = 49.46    1/alpha_Y = 55.48    sum = 104.94
  the corpus's handouts:   49.4              55.5              104.9

  So the Planck-floor value is not an extrapolation to be apologised for -- it is the
  tree-level composition of two one-loop-run couplings, and it reproduces both handouts.

